Petitioner has relied upon the following documents viz:-
""Ex PW1/1 (OSR) is copy of driving license of PW-1;
Ex.PW1/2 (Colly) is medical treatment papers; Ex.PW1/3 (colly) is original medical bills; Ex.PW1/4 (OSR) is copy of Aadhar Card of PW-1;
Ex.PW1/5 is complete DAR''.

Ex.PW2/2 (Colly) is attested copy of Offer Letter/ Appoitment letter of petitioner dated 08/11/2019;
Ex.PW2/3 (Colly) is attested photocopies of education documents i.e. 10th Marksheet, 12th Marksheet and B. Com Marksheet;
Ex.PW2/4 (OSR) is copy of ID Card of PW-2.
